    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a puzzle to solve, not a rigid set of rules. Growing up with a parent who has a PhD, I was exposed to its beauty but also its complexity. I enjoy it because it connects to real-world problems, like analyzing football statistics or designing patterns in photography. It’s challenging but deeply satisfying when I crack a problem.",
